# "Target player" may be its own controller. Bot1 spends its whole hand (two more Moxen beside the Gearhulk's four mana sources) so its hand is empty when the
# enters trigger resolves with Bot1 as the target: there is no card to choose, so no choice is asked, and "if you do" is not met - nobody
# discards and Bot1 does NOT draw. Its library keeps all its cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Oildeep Gearhulk
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
